{
  "path": "lua/ge/extensions/gameplay/markers/invisibleMarker.lua",
  "module": "\"Null\" marker: implements the entire play mode marker interface (init, setup, update, show, hide, clearObjects, interactInPlayMode...) with empty methods, except setup which stores the cluster. Serves as the default marker for POIs that have no visible representation or interaction. The module directly returns a constructor: require(...)(options) returns the instance.",
  "notes": [
    "This module does not provide a cluster function: it groups no POIs.",
    "All methods are empty shells, except setup (self.cluster = cluster)."
  ],
